# Conversation Engine Authority

Hub conversation list tips paint from `lib/community-messenger/conversation-engine/` (`ConversationStore` + `applyConversationEvent`).

## DO NOT

- Add new `applyHomeListPatch` tip paths for hub list live updates
- Re-enable silent hydrated `refresh(true)` for tip catch-up
- Import quarantined legacy list writers from `conversation-engine/**`
- Put trade/store_order rows into GD hub scroll list

## DO

- Emit `conversation_upsert` via `publishConversationUpsertAfterTipWrite` on server tip writes
- Route client tip events through conversation engine apply helpers
- Keep room timeline + Native call runtime unchanged

